  "text": {
    "tagline": "Uncle Homunculus plays the office piano. Everyone sings along.",
    "credit": "Sounds by Paul Chauncy (Uncle Homunculus / Paulywauly)",
    "blurb": "The office piano, the hum from the back row, the bass from Accounts and a bee-buzzing organ: {count} presets for the Friday singalong. Sounds by Paul Chauncy (Uncle Homunculus / Paulywauly).",
    "intro": [
      "Welcome to Paulywaulophone, Volume 1: The Office Singalong Collection. These presets turn your computer into the office piano, the choir that gathers round it, and the odd instruments people bring from home.",
      "Sounds by Paul Chauncy (Uncle Homunculus / Paulywauly). The doo, hmm, boop, flutecorder, glock, fork, guitar pad, bee organ, flute and sax are his own recordings, used with his permission."
    ],
    "maker_note": [
      "Every office has one person who can play anything on the old piano by the coffee machine. On this disc that person is Uncle Homunculus.",
      "Hand out the song sheet, dim the fluorescent lights and play.",
      "The Breakroom Media Group"
    ],
    "install": [
      "Insert the disc. In the Library tab it appears as PAULYWAULO.",
      "Open a folder and double-click a preset to load it.",
      "The song book is SONGBOOK.PDF."
    ],
    "license": [
      "BREAKROOM MEDIA GROUP LICENSE",
      "You may use the presets on one computer and use the sounds you make with them in your own music.",
      "The source recordings are by Paul Chauncy (Uncle Homunculus / Paulywauly) and are used with his permission. They may not be extracted, resold or redistributed as a sound collection.",
      "No warranty. Sing responsibly."
    ],
